notes:"Independent global Audit A only, for spec.json SHA256 3d9d9764a5972af3b0827ff08d666e0bb6f0440ae4fa46e06082c5b58c7200bf and nl0.json SHA256 af8b293d3e6c3f0bf46cf6a18307af63faf4bfc621720424115ca600195de488. All assigned global items assessed. No E nodes are retained; sources are exactly M001-M006. This judgment does not certify R proof bodies or their per-consumer applications.",
